<!-- Pixel fonts. These are drawn on a pixel grid and only render
     sharply at a pixel size that is a multiple of their grid, with
     QFont::NoAntialias set. Off-grid sizes give uneven stem widths.
       Galmuri7, GalmuriMono7                      8 px  (16, 24, ...)
       Galmuri9, GalmuriMono9, ark-pixel-10px     10 px  (20, 30, ...)
       Galmuri11, -Bold, -Condensed,
         GalmuriMono11, ark-pixel-12px            12 px  (24, 36, ...)
       CozetteVector                              13 px  (26, 39, ...)
       Galmuri14                                  15 px  (30, 45, ...)
       ark-pixel-16px                             16 px  (32, 48, ...)
       DepartureMono                              11 px  (22, 33, ...)
     Galmuri11-Bold and Galmuri11-Condensed share the "Galmuri11"
     family; select them with QFont::setStyleName("Bold"/"Condensed").
     Remember the device pixel ratio multiplies the size: a fractional
     ratio such as 1.5 puts every one of these off the grid. -->
<file>fonts/Galmuri7.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/Galmuri9.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/Galmuri11.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/Galmuri11-Bold.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/Galmuri11-Condensed.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/Galmuri14.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/GalmuriMono7.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/GalmuriMono9.ttf</file>
<file>fonts/GalmuriMono11.ttf</file>
